maksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wwe4xBPasPoQ7kNvwH_IUO7&_nc_oc=AdouGqzLP9YKbW41gO7ijUp3MFXyVq5-hZmPFEb_jXvEOHgTqwkR5Lm8Mo3bi1x-ApI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_cj0GpfIdmYF4ZjtWuKRF-zENcmtfCMyIe86KGMOk_5A&oe=6A36C814"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=axL_sABQAzcQ7kNvwHJW2TY&_nc_oc=AdpTzs1WSMavNOxHwEo3rNQviQMmvDZ8iNeBQBc1GgyXrPpHb1OImgpcO3LrkrFHL5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-nJpifeThANnhXnxw71q3h9dqMm1k_jF4KWcNqfiTkBQ&oe=6A3694B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D6Z88nV-dc4Q7kNvwGzRkIb&_nc_oc=AdpwWgzsXkhp8x2e5-j-v7MMdBJksQRK1K48FX6WuTuS0Flt0Ch7t4ljOljRQ3bt1KI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9w8y34V2Uugu5abQ5xbExgns6zaA0Vtn-G5hW45D4PIA&oe=6A36A255"}, {"file_name":